cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "The Singularity Gate v2.1"
abstract: >-
  The Singularity Gate tests whether AI models can predict paradigm-breaking scientific discoveries, inventions and
  breakthroughs made public after their training cutoff. Version 2.1 has 80 tasks with no public trace before July
  2026, answered by eight models and scored by two blind cross-lab judges.
